  "explanation": "This is a project-local mechanism study, not a reproduction of Bardes et al. The three pretraining arms differ by exactly one of equation (6)'s coefficients and the fourth removes pretraining, so the spread and redundancy gaps attribute an effect to the variance and covariance terms on this fixture at this budget. The outcome target is a guardrail on transfer, not evidence of causal identification: card \u00a72 excludes ImageNet reproduction, superiority to SCARF and treatment-effect recovery from the claim, and the treatment NLL, ATE error and view-damage diagnostics are reported for the audit card \u00a76.4 requires before a downstream number is read as a statement about the objective. Failed target(s): full_arm_embedding_spread was 0.268395 +/- 0.00169 against mean >= 0.5, by at least one stderr.",
